Domain Entity AssessmentAdministrationParticipation
    documentation "Identifies the point of contact for the administration of an assessment under the purview of an education organization."
    domain entity AssessmentAdministration
        documentation "A reference to the assessment administration for which participation is being indicated."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization for which participation is being indicated."
        is part of identity
        role name Participating
    common AdministrationPointOfContact
        documentation "Pre-identified contacts for education organizations administering the assessment."
        is optional collection